# MODAL-05 — Prevent background scroll while open

## Rationale

The page behind the modal should not scroll while open.

## How to check

Check for scroll-lock (e.g. `overflow:hidden` on `body`) on open and removal on close.

## How to fix

Propose the scroll-lock toggle paired with open/close.
